      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i just got some floor cleaner in my left eye while mopping. it's stinging a lot and looks super red. i have some leftover Tobramycin eye drops from a prescription i had last year... i'm really worried the chemicals are gonna cause a bad infection or something. should i just put a few drops of those in now to kill any bacteria so it doesn't get worse?",
